unt":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"HSiktA5zdqPVULY3ThmXIg","review_id":"a3rpGtr_oqlnkEfmsERLRA","date":"2018-01-24T15:21:35","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9052882194519043,"text_excerpt":"Great service & dive bar. Love the late night jalapeño poppers & fried chicken sandwich that had a side of jalapeños. Drinks were great too! No one was really there so it was chill. Will be back soon when I'm not leaving Bourbon Street."},{"business_id":"HSiktA5zdqPVULY3ThmXIg","review_id":"sSDVvsuBvIticRansGvvbA","date":"2019-02-08T00:08:50","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9044864773750305,"text_excerpt":"Locals bar just off main drag, food is excellent and cheap prices. Not highly frequented by convention goers either. Great spot."},{"business_id":"HSiktA5zdqPVULY3ThmXIg","review_id":"nAqA0BNfCaqarMTi-jRcRA","date":"2016-12-31T21:47:13","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9023571014404297,"text_excerpt":"Gets the 5 stars in the \"dive bar with later. Ugh this food category\". Super friendly mother/daughter team keep the \"industry\" folk happy with after-shift hospitality for bartenders, hotel staffers - but surrounded by hotels, it's perfect for guests who want a laid-back locals experience. A Miller Lite here is $4.25. At the uber touristy Absinthe House, the same beer is $6 - unless it's a special event like the Sugar Bowl, when that place raises the price to $7. So Alibi may not have the fireplace that Absinthe has - but the service is more genuine at better prices. Food is said to be solid, and it is somewhat hard to find good food at 3-4 AM - so huge kudos for that."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"HSik